  "releaseNotes": "Auto-register multiple interfaces; add Register helper\n      - Extend plugin auto-registration to collect interfaces that either match I{TypeName} or live in a namespace containing \"Contract\", and register each matching interface to the implementation.\n      - If no matching interfaces are found, register the implementation type as the service.\n      - Extract lifetime-based registration logic into a new private Register(lifetime, serviceType, implementationType) helper to avoid duplication and centralize Singleton/Transient handling.",
